rs. She has raised more than Bresnahan overall and roughly doubled his third-quarter total, while outside groups have spent $2.7 million attacking the incumbent. Rating outlets split between tossup and Democratic-favoring flip calls, and prediction markets price her chances near 80 percent. Bresnahan's cash advantage and incumbency keep this competitive, but the weight of evidence favors a narrow Democratic win.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5916, "margin": 1.42}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6449, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6453, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6734, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.617, "margin": 2.4}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6201, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6673, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6811, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6435, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6763, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6884, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6826, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6869, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.604, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6236, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.595, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6554, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6187, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6202, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6227, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7084, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6779, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.6699, "margin": 2.8}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.6498, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.6351, "margin": 2.8}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.6569, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.662, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "p_dem": 0.6538, "margin": 3.0}, {"dat